                 ║                                                                          ║                 
                 ║  Command Palette                                                         ║                 
                 ║                                                                          ║                 
                 ║    [type to filter]                                                      ║                 
                 ║                                                                          ║                 
                 ║    pause  Pause after current session ends                               ║                 
                 ║    resume  Resume a paused run                                           ║                 
                 ║    approve  Approve and continue                                         ║                 
                 ║    skip  Skip current stage                                              ║                 
                 ║  ⚠ abort  Abort run immediately                                          ║                 
                 ║  ⚠ kill  Kill current agent session                                      ║                 
                 ║    stop-after  Stop after current session                                ║                 
                 ║  ⚠ retry-stage  Reset attempt counter, retry stage                       ║                 
                 ║  ⚠ rollback  Git reset --hard to stage start                             ║                 
                 ║    pause-after-stage  Pause once stage completes                         ║                 
                 ║    goto  Jump to a different stage (requires stage ID)                   ║                 
                 ║                                                                          ║                 
                 ║  [↑↓: navigate] [enter: execute] [esc: close] [type: filter]             ║                 
                 ║                                                                          ║                 
                 ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝                 
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              